{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bf8f6601a8aea905","name":"500 \"ESPO\" Riot Gun","source":{"id":"source:reference-bf8f6601a8aea905","title":"500 \"ESPO\" Riot Gun","revision":19828,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:40:52Z","sha256":"1ed5fc8c52eed59409127eee72781daec9cf2ec10d22870634d0328940f7a378","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19828","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=500%20%22ESPO%22%20Riot%20Gun&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bf8f6601a8aea905","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Best known as the \"ESPO\" gun due to its wide use by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector Authority"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector_Authority","referenceId":"reference:3e2d5cb8bf4c298d"},", the BlasTech 500 is a compact blaster with a short barrel and an open-frame stock. Designed for use against large crowds, the weapon trades simple accuracy for the ability to hit just about anything in its path. Operating best in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," mode, the rifle incurs a -2 penalty when used as a Single-Shot weapon (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},").\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Apart from the brown color of their armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Espo Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Espo_Troopers"}," are known for their Riot Guns, manufactured by BlasTech Industries. The BlasTech 500 \"ESPO\" Riot Gun is standard issue for all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Espo Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Espo_Troopers"},". It functions, in most ways, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbine","referenceId":"reference:76b5919337653c76"},"; however, the Riot Gun is known for its indiscriminate accuracy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When in Single-Shot mode, the Riot Gun imposes a -1 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," rolls; however, the weapon grants a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attacks made by the weapon (meaning that, for most wielders, the weapon can be fired in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," mode with only a -3 penalty, instead of the normal -5). (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A 500 \"ESPO\" Riot Gun requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 50 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2.2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
